lient and self._server_client.connected:\n        features = self._load_features(self.active_board)\n        self._push_to_server(features[:])\n```\n\nThis is a **synchronous** method but it's passed as a callback to `ServerClient.__init__` via `on_set_auto_mode=self._handle_set_auto_mode`. However, looking at server_client.py:\n\n```python\nself._on_set_auto_mode(mode, enabled)\n```\n\nThis is called synchronously inside `_handle_incoming` (which is an async method), so it's being called without await. This should work because `_handle_set_auto_mode` is a regular function, not an async function. Let me check the callback invocation in server_client.py:\n\n```python\nif self._on_set_auto_mode:\n    try:\n        self._on_set_auto_mode(mode, enabled)\n    except Exception as e:\n        logger.warning(f\"Error handling set_auto_mode: {e}\")\n```\n\nYes, it's called synchronously, which is correct.\n\nNow let me check if there are any other issues. Let me look at the plan more carefully:\n\n**Plan Item 1: Pipeline client: Include auto-mode state in state_update messages**\n\n\n- server_client.py handles this at lines 88-98 and 155-156 ✓\n- tui.py passes auto_mode state through all push_state() calls ✓\n\n**Plan Item 2: Pipeline client: Handle incoming set_auto_mode WebSocket messages**\n- server_client.py lines 196-204 handle this ✓\n- tui.py lines 1216 and 1259-1269 wire up the callback ✓\n\n**Plan Item 3: Server: Store and expose auto-mode state**\n- hub.go lines 66-67 define AutoPlan/AutoImpl ✓\n- hub.go lines 256-267 parse state updates ✓\n\n**Plan Item 4: Server: API endpoint to toggle auto-modes**\n- api.go implements the toggle logic ✓\n\n**Plan Item 5: Web UI: Add toggle buttons**\n- client.html has toggle buttons ✓\n- toggleAutoMode function handles button interactions ✓\n- pollAgentStatus function updates button states ✓\n\nThe implementation appears complete across all components. Now I should verify if there are any Go server tests covering this functionality.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":"5957bcde997523692c077036eb244edbbc7c9efa5b133e999e5e4b4c0010618a"}]}}}}
